# 基础词 Unit16
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit16核心词汇

{{direction}}{/dəˈrekʃn/}{{n. 方向；指导}}{{In which direction should we go from here?}}
{{director}}{/dəˈrektər/}}n. 导演；主任；董事}}{{The film director won an award at the festival.}}
{{disappoint}}{/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪnt/}}v. 使失望}}{{The test results disappointed the entire team.}}
{{disaster}}{/dɪˈzɑːstər/}}n. 灾难；不幸}}{{The flood was one of the worst natural disasters in history.}}
{{discipline}}{/ˈdɪsɪplɪn/}}n. 纪律；学科；v. 训练}}{{Self-discipline is the key to achieving your goals.}}
{{discount}}{/ˈdɪskaʊnt/}}n. 折扣；v. 打折}}{{The store offers a 20% discount on all items.}}
{{discover}}{/dɪˈskʌvər/}}v. 发现；找到}}{{Columbus discovered America in 1492.}}
{{discrimination}}{/dɪˌskrɪmɪˈneɪʃn/}}n. 歧视；辨别}}{{Discrimination based on race is illegal in many countries.}}
{{discuss}}{/dɪˈskʌs/}}v. 讨论；商讨}}{{Let's discuss the plan at tomorrow's meeting.}}
{{disease}}{/dɪˈziːz/}}n. 疾病；弊病}}{{Heart disease is one of the leading causes of death.}}
{{dismiss}}{/dɪˈsmɪs/}}v. 解雇；驳回；不予理会}}{{The manager dismissed the employee for poor performance.}}
{{display}}{/dɪˈspleɪ/}}v./n. 展示；陈列}}{{The museum displays ancient artifacts from around the world.}}
{{dispute}}{/dɪˈspjuːt/}}n. 争论；v. 争论}}{{The two countries are involved in a territorial dispute.}}
{{distance}}{/ˈdɪstəns/}}n. 距离；远方}}{{The distance between the two cities is about 300 kilometers.}}
{{distinct}}{/dɪˈstɪŋkt/}}adj. 明显的；不同的}}{{There are two distinct types of this species.}}
{{distinguish}}{/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ/}}v. 区分；辨别}}{{It is hard to distinguish the twins from each other.}}
{{distribute}}{/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/}}v. 分配；分发}}{{The volunteers distributed food to the homeless.}}
{{district}}{/ˈdɪstrɪkt/}}n. 区；地区}}{{The business district is located in the center of the city.}}
{{disturb}}{/dɪˈstɜːrb/}}v. 打扰；扰乱}}{{Please do not disturb me while I am studying.}}
{{divide}}{/dɪˈvaɪd/}}v. 分开；除；n. 分歧}}{{The river divides the city into two parts.}}
{{document}}{/ˈdɒkjumənt/}n. 文件；v. 记录}}{{Please sign the document and return it to us.}}
{{dog}}{/dɒɡ/}}n. 狗}}{{The dog greeted its owner at the door.}}
{{dollar}}{/ˈdɒlər/}}n. 美元}}{{The book costs about ten dollars.}}
{{domestic}}{/dəˈmestɪk/}}adj. 国内的；家庭的}}{{Domestic flights are usually cheaper than international ones.}}
{{dominate}}{/ˈdɒmɪneɪt/}}v. 支配；占主导地位}}{{The company dominates the global market.}}
{{donate}}{/dəʊˈneɪt/}}v. 捐赠；捐献}}{{They donated a large sum of money to the charity.}}
{{door}}{/dɔːr/}}n. 门；出入口}}{{Please close the door when you leave the room.}}
{{double}}{/ˈdʌbl/}}adj. 双倍的；v. 加倍}}{{The number of visitors doubled compared to last year.}}
{{doubt}}{/daʊt/}}n. 怀疑；v. 怀疑}}{{There is no doubt that he is the best candidate.}}
{{down}}{/daʊn/}}adv. 向下；prep. 沿着}}{{She walked down the stairs to the basement.}}
{{downtown}}{/ˌdaʊnˈtaʊn/}}adv./n. 在市中心；闹市}}{{We went downtown to do some shopping.}}
{{draft}}{/drɑːft/}}n. 草稿；草案；v. 起草}}{{The lawyer drafted a new contract for the client.}}
{{drag}}{/dræɡ/}}v. 拖；拽}}{{He dragged the heavy box across the floor.}}
{{drama}}{/ˈdrɑːmə/}}n. 戏剧；剧本}}{{She studied drama at a performing arts school.}}
{{draw}}{/drɔː/}}v. 画；拉；吸引}}{{The artist drew a portrait of the famous writer.}}
{{dream}}{/driːm/}}n. 梦想；v. 做梦}}{{Her dream is to become a successful entrepreneur.}}
{{dress}}{/dres/}}n. 连衣裙；v. 穿衣}}{{She wore a beautiful red dress to the party.}}
{{drink}}{/drɪŋk/}}v. 喝；n. 饮料}}{{Would you like something to drink with your meal?}}
{{drive}}{/draɪv/}}v. 驾驶；驱动}}{{It takes about two hours to drive to the airport.}}
{{drop}}{/drɒp/}}v. 掉落；下降；n. 滴}}{{The temperature dropped sharply during the night.}}
